  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.8.200\n\nReleased on 2026-10-25.\n\nThe preview draws only the scenes near the playhead, so long projects scrub faster. Renders size their capture browsers by frame cost and keep fast capture on for more frames.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Producer:** The audio peak correction sizes its cut from the PCM it re-encodes ([1a37db4aee](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/1a37db4aee9349e6c619313475159e90b49da083), [#6312](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6312)).\n\n## Performance\n\n- **Core:** The preview mounts and draws only the scenes near the playhead ([70187a13b5](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/70187a13b59118cf056f3bcdcd0c0df8f453a9f8), [#6189](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6189)).\n- **Engine:** Fast capture stays on for frames a shadow, blur or clip effect does not touch ([c50918277a](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/c50918277ae69b45677c200e95575faec5fd1519), [#6318](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6318)).\n- **Producer:** Size a chunk's capture browsers by its frame cost, not its frame count ([69405a7736](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/69405a7736830f743dc2a8192c36f26dac99d4ae), [#6319](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6319)).\n\n## Internal\n\n- Run cli tests in their own job so runtime tests stop timing out ([8214cdcd29](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/8214cdcd295de9542a05b8484ccf1b48ed97937b), [#6326](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6326)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.8.199...v0.8.200\n"
}
